title Todo Webapp with Authentication
# Reconciled against the current PRD: no architectural change required.

component todo-webapp as "Todo Webapp" web-application
component todo-api as "Todo API" service
component todo-db as "Todo Database" database

east user-auth as "Thunder Auth" identity-server

north -> todo-webapp

todo-webapp -> todo-api
todo-webapp -> user-auth
todo-api -> user-auth
todo-api -> todo-db
